#: includes/Modules/BotThrottle/BanNotifier.php:63
#, php-format
msgid "An IP sent far more requests than a normal visitor to \"%1$s\" and was banned for %2$d minutes. The raw IP is never stored, only a salted hash, so it can be matched against server logs if needed."
